    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing... the \"story\" is over. i've spent my whole life training for one specific version of existence. that person was fast, agile, purposeful. now i'm just a spectator in a body that failed me. it feels more like a mourning process than a \"new chapter.\" how can you expect someone to just keep going when the very essence of who they were has been completely erased? it feels like the lights went out and i'm just sitting in the dark.",
